<title>USA: Elmwood Park, N.J., won by PNC Securities.</title>
<headline>Elmwood Park, N.J., won by PNC Securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>PNC Securities said it won $2.607 million of Elmwoood Park, N.J., general improvement bonds, with a lowest rate of 5.00, highest price of 1000.0818.</p>
</text>
